#: ../../source/docs/rover-vectored-thrust.rst:5
#: ba2cd603b7b94626900f9d1bdcb17304
msgid "Vectored Thrust"
msgstr "矢量推力"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-vectored-thrust.rst:10
#: 6b63f2d59b5c4df3abe0e0a13b142cc4
msgid ""
"*above image is of a Sprint F3 boat from HobbyKing* (`link "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/sprint-f3-fiberglass-tunnel-hull-brushless-"
"racing-boat-w-motor-630mm.html>`__)"
msgstr ""
"*上图为来自 HobbyKing 的 Sprint F3 船* (`链接 "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/sprint-f3-fiberglass-tunnel-hull-brushless-"
"racing-boat-w-motor-630mm.html>`__)"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-vectored-thrust.rst:12
#: eeeb396d750740d287d1dec406394a05
msgid ""
"The \"Vectored thrust\" feature improves steering control for :ref:`boats "
"<boat-configuration>` and hovercraft that use a steering servo to aim the "
"motor. This feature should not be used on cars or boats with a rudder that "
"is controlled separately from the motors."
msgstr ""
"「矢量推力」功能改善了使用转向舵机来对准电机的 :ref:`船 <boat-configuration>` "
"和气垫船的转向控制。该功能不适用于汽车或舵独立于电机控制的船。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-vectored-thrust.rst:15
#: f73b79654f344bd5891b16670b705dcb
msgid ""
"In Rover-4.1.0 (and higher) the feature is enabled by setting "
":ref:`MOT_VEC_ANGLEMAX <MOT_VEC_ANGLEMAX>` to the angle of deflection of the"
" motor when the steering servo is at its maximum position."
msgstr ""
"在 Rover-4.1.0（及更高版本）中，通过将 :ref:`MOT_VEC_ANGLEMAX <MOT_VEC_ANGLEMAX>` "
"设为转向舵机处于最大位置时电机的偏转角来启用该功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-vectored-thrust.rst:19
#: 98fd5d8769f5427caa8ee18d00e0b5cd
msgid ""
"In 4.0 (and earlier) this features was enabled by setting the "
"``MOT_VEC_THR_BASE`` parameter to a value between 10 and 30 (normally 20 "
"works well). This parameter specifies:"
msgstr ""
"在 4.0（及更早版本）中，通过将 ``MOT_VEC_THR_BASE`` 参数设为 10 至 30 之间的值（通常 20 "
"效果较好）来启用该功能。该参数指定："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-vectored-thrust.rst:22
#: 7df7fa5c8829499fa9b4d02f20d55e2d
msgid ""
"the throttle level above which the steering servo will be scaled towards the"
" center.  I.e. if set to 20%, the steering response will be unrestricted "
"between 0% and 20% throttle but above 20% throttle it will be scaled towards"
" the center more and more as throttle increases."
msgstr ""
"转向舵机开始向中心缩放的油门水平。即若设为 20%，在 0% 至 20% 油门之间转向响应不受限制，但超过 20% "
"油门后，随油门增加转向响应将越来越向中心缩减。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-vectored-thrust.rst:23
#: 9f6b4eef85354cbe8edc53b28d0a144c
#, python-format
msgid ""
"the maximum steering response at full throttle expressed as a percentage.  "
"I.e. if set to 20%, at full throttle, full steering input will only result "
"in the steering servo moving 20% of its full range."
msgstr "满油门时的最大转向响应（以百分比表示）。即若设为 20%，满油门时，满转向输入将仅使转向舵机移动其全范围的 20%。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-vectored-thrust.rst:25
#: d2d7bd8303ee4949881138d4eb6b6f12
msgid ""
"The rough image below shows how the steering servo angle must be reduced as "
"the throttle increases in order to achieve a desired steering response."
msgstr "下面的示意图显示了为实现期望转向响应，随油门增加转向舵机角度必须减小的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-vectored-thrust.rst:30
#: edda0bb6e2e3418bbcec5867ad6c40cb
msgid ""
"The graph below shows how the steering response is reduced as the throttle "
"is increased when ``MOT_VEC_THR_BASE`` = 30."
msgstr "下图显示了当 ``MOT_VEC_THR_BASE`` = 30 时，随油门增加转向响应减弱的情况。"
